[b]v1.0.0 — First release[/b]
[list]
[*]Kill & knockout counter per squad member, by victim race and faction. Covers melee, ranged, animals and stealth knockouts/assassinations.
[*]16 achievements with popup, message-log entry and Kenshi's notification sound. Editable in achievements.txt.
[*]F6 panel with Statistics (selected character, squad total, per character) and Achievements tabs.
[*]Stats saved inside each save file.
[*]Any game language (English + Português included; translations welcome).
[/list]
Requires RE_Kenshi v0.3.5+. Full changelog: [url=https://github.com/LucasSKrewer/kenshi-achievements/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md]GitHub[/url]
